# Search-ignore file for ripgrep and ripgrep-based tools, including the
# code search in coding agents such as Claude Code and Codex. It does NOT
# affect git: these paths stay tracked and are part of every checkout.
#
# docs/archive/ holds the plans and reviews of closed issues. It is history,
# not current authority, so it is left out of default searches to keep old or
# rejected designs from being read as current decisions. See "Archiving plans
# and reviews" in AGENTS.md.
#
# Search it deliberately when you need history. Naming the path searches it
# even though it is ignored; --no-ignore includes it in a whole-repo search:
#   rg <pattern> docs/archive/
#   rg --no-ignore <pattern>
# Plain `grep -r` and `git grep` do not read this file.
docs/archive/
